msgid ""
"Five years after Endor, Grand Admiral Thrawn takes command of the Imperial Remnant. Follow Luke Skywalker, Leia Organa Solo, Han Solo, and their allies from the forests of Myrkr to the shipyards of Sluis Van as the Grand Admiral's plans unfold.\n"
