msgid ""
"Thrawn besieges Coruscant with invisible asteroids. Karrde rallies the smugglers. Luke and Mara Jade descend on Wayland, where the Emperor's storehouse hides the Grand Admiral's cloning vats and the mad Jedi C'baoth waits with a clone of Luke.\n"
"\n"
"Campaign III of an original, fan-made Thrawn Trilogy total conversion. Ten missions.\n"
"\n"
""
