"A faster, more heavily armed TIE design flown by the Remnant's best pilots.\n"
"\n"
"Role — Elite dogfighter: the Remnant's best pilots hunt enemy fighters and bombers with four cannons. Unshielded, it relies on speed and agility.\n"
