"Double-hulled TIE bombers carry concussion bombs for stations and capital ships.\n"
"\n"
"Role — Bomber: slow and sturdy, it carries concussion bombs for stations and capital ships. Its bombs are nearly useless against craft that can dodge, so it needs an escort.\n"
"\n"
"Rank abilities — Veteran: bombardier; Seasoned veteran: armoured hull; Elite: ship-killer."
