msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_nr_recon_squad, race=human
#: units/infantry.cfg:279
msgid "A nimble light-infantry unit specializing in rapid reconnaissance and flanking maneuvers. Equipped with a suppressed blaster and lightweight gear, the Recon Squad moves quickly across the battlefield to gather intelligence and strike vulnerable positions."
