msgid "Imperial Remnant Recon Squad"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type]: id=sw_unit_im_recon_squad, race=human
#: units/infantry.cfg:350
msgid "A swift Imperial reconnaissance squad operating ahead of main forces. Equipped with a suppressed blaster pistol and minimal armor, these troopers specialize in forward observation, target designation, and harassment strikes. Their light equipment makes them vulnerable in prolonged engagements, but their speed and stealth keep them ahead of the enemy line."
