#: units/infantry.cfg:815
msgid "A lightweight tech-support team specializing in electronic warfare and system infiltration. Equipped with a blaster pistol and portable hacking tools, the Slicer Team bypasses enemy defenses and disables hostile systems from a distance. Their low armor makes them vulnerable in direct engagements, but their speed and versatility keep them valuable on any battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. [attack]: type=pierce
#: units/infantry.cfg:923
msgid "hacking tool"
msgstr ""

#. [defense]
#: units/infantry.cfg:949
